  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Cold War Triangle (2021), published by Leuven University Press, has been cited 2 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Cold War Triangle by Renilde Loeckx was published by Leuven University Press in 2021. Conceptually, the work connects to Cold war, Human immunodeficiency virus (HIV), History, Ancient history and Geography.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 2 citations. Notable citing venues include Biochemical Pharmacology and Isis. They come from 2 countries, led by Belgium and China.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 20 times via OAPEN.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\" data-wiki-books=\"verified\">The latest English Wikipedia check verified 1 article–work reference matches. These are references or bibliography entries, which may include other editions of the same work; they do not measure readership.</p>\n",
